'' RUN: string slices under -exx (docs/tiko-slices RFC-0002 §7, RFC-0001 §5): 'v[i]' past the slice's length. The
'' -earray check stops it with runtime error 6 and exit 6 where the slice is read; without -exx no
'' check is emitted (the other string-slice run tests).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -exx -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/string-slice-exx-index.tiko -o tests/codegen/stringsliceexxindex.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/stringsliceexxindex.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/stringsliceexxindex.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: runtime error 6 (out of bounds array access) at line 5 of
